    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lost Balls: In Search of Lost Balls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost Balls: In Search of Lost Balls is a thrilling TPS genre game. Players take on the role of Vincent, a golf course worker in the midst of a midlife crisis, who must find lost golf balls while avoiding gangsters in a dark and atmospheric harbor setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513560/extras/a9b8c9c0654b588903b56fe3fe5fbcab.avif?t=1740731948\" data-has-big width=800 height=498 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exciting Story Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By clearing the story mode, you can watch an ending video containing a hidden story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Challenge in Infinite Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In infinite mode, you can test your limits and record the highest score by continuously clearing stages while avoiding the gangsters' interference.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513560/extras/e3048660189c4e6b9731408493e203f8.avif?t=1740731948\" data-has-big width=800 height=498 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thrilling Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a tense chase unfolding in a dark harbor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Main Character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the interesting story of Vincent, a golf course worker experiencing a midlife crisis.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gangster Threats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid unique gangsters and collect lost golf balls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the diverse fun through story mode and infinite mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513560/extras/79584bf1ccb49c79aa01983b429e5c27.avif?t=1740731948\" data-has-big width=800 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your only skill is to use the minimap to figure out the location of your enemies.</h2>",
